=== OWNER APPROVAL PROVENANCE ===
The Session & Physical-Domain Partitioned Seating Engine specification (78 sections,
including the physical-domain partition invariants, seat-label channeling formulation
X/O/D/Y/K with EMPTY sentinels, three anti-adjacency policy modes, the 1000-candidate
hard ceiling, composition/capacity guards, objective reporting rule, error-code table,
status terms, and Phase A-E implementation order) was PROVIDED BY THE OWNER and
APPROVED FOR IMPLEMENTATION in the OpenCode session on 2026-08-15.
No solver/model decision in this milestone was self-approved by the agent; where the
spec left a choice, the chosen value is a documented INTERPRETATION below.
Owner correction (recorded 2026-08-15): composition risk ratios (e.g. >0.50) are
CONFIGURABLE scheduling-risk thresholds, NOT mathematical infeasibility proofs;
the 1000-candidate domain ceiling remains a HARD architectural guard until benchmark
evidence supports raising it.

