=== MEASURED FACT vs TARGET HYPOTHESIS vs INTERPRETATION ===
- MEASURED FACT: Phase D/E timings, memory, var/con counts above (raw logs cited below).
- TARGET HYPOTHESIS: Phase E buckets were hypothesis (§49); now measured. Seat counts in
  the buckets equal candidate counts exactly (200/500/800/1000 seats).
- INTERPRETATION: seat-label D[i]!=D[j] reification dominates per-domain solve cost
  (~3-4 s per 100-seat domain on the 8-core host); time/memory scale linearly with
  domain count. Not a solver defect.

